child::after{content:none}</style><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173156\">.mw-parser-output .navbar{display:inline;font-weight:normal}.mw-parser-output .navbar-collapse{float:left;text-align:left}.mw-parser-output .navbar-boxtext{word-spacing:0}.mw-parser-output .navbar ul{display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;line-height:inherit}.mw-parser-output .navbar-brackets::before{margin-right:-0.125em;content:\"[ \"}.mw-parser-output .navbar-brackets::after{margin-left:-0.125em;content:\" ]\"}.mw-parser-output .navbar li{word-spacing:-0.125em}.mw-parser-output .navbar a>span,.mw-parser-output .navbar a>abbr{text-decoration:inherit}.mw-parser-output .navbar-mini abbr{font-variant:small-caps;border-bottom:none;text-decoration:none;cursor:inherit}.mw-parser-output .navbar-ct-full{font-size:110%;margin:0 8em}.mw-parser-output .navbar-ct-mini{font-size:110%;margin:0 5em}html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .navbar li a abbr{color:var(--color-base)!important}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .navbar li a abbr{color:var(--color-base)!important}}@media print{.mw-parser-output .navbar{display:none!important}}</style><div class=\"navbar plainlinks hlist navbar-mini\"><ul><li class=\"nv-view\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Addiction_glossary\" title=\"Template:Addiction glossary\"><abbr title=\"檢視該模板\">閱</abbr></a></li><li class=\"nv-talk\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template_talk:Addiction_glossary\" title=\"Template talk:Addiction glossary\"><abbr title=\"討論該模板\">論</abbr></a></li><li class=\"nv-edit\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:EditPage/Template:Addiction_glossary\" title=\"Special:EditPage/Template:Addiction glossary\"><abbr title=\"編輯該模板\">編</abbr></a></li></ul></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>犒賞系統</b>（英語：<span lang=\"en\">reward system</span>）是<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%84%91\" title=\"腦\">大腦</a>的一組神經結構，旨在維護<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"动机显著性\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"incentive salience\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%8A%A8%E6%9C%BA%E6%98%BE%E8%91%97%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"動機顯著性（頁面不存在）\">動機顯著性</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/incentive_salience\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:incentive salience\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">incentive salience</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>（也就是動機、需求、喜好等）、<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0\" title=\"學習\">聯想學習</a>（主要依靠<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A2%9E%E5%BC%BA\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"增強\">增強</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%A4%E5%85%B8%E5%88%B6%E7%B4%84\" title=\"古典制約\">古典制約</a>）和<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"正面情感\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Positive affectivity\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%AD%A3%E9%9D%A2%E6%83%85%E6%84%9F&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"正面情感（頁面不存在）\">正面情感</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Positive_affectivity\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Positive affectivity\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Positive affectivity</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>（尤其是以<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%84%89%E5%BF%AB\" title=\"愉快\">愉悅感</a>為核心的情感）。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Schultz&#95;5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Schultz-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><b>犒賞</b>通常是極具誘惑的刺激，能夠引導出滿足欲望的行為。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Schultz&#95;5-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Schultz-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>主要犒賞（primary reward）是那些對於<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%BC%94%E5%8C%96\" title=\"演化\">個人與其子嗣生存</a>十分必要的犒賞，包括有助於維持<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A8%B3%E6%80%81\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"穩態\">穩態</a>（如食物）、錢財的犒賞。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Schultz&#95;5-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Schultz-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>內在犒賞（intrinsic rewards）則因其本身即可帶來愉悅感，而是一種無條件的犒賞。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Schultz&#95;5-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Schultz-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>外在犒賞（extrinsic rewards，如錢財）則是有條件的犒賞——其本身並不能為人直接帶來愉悅感，但卻吸引、激勵著人們。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Schultz&#95;5-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Schultz-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>通過<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0\" title=\"學習\">習得聯繫</a>，外在犒賞會逐漸與內在犒賞建立起聯繫。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Schultz&#95;5-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Schultz-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>大多數動物物種的生存取決於最大限度地與有益刺激的接觸和最小限度地與有害刺激的接觸。獎賞認知的作用是通過引起聯想學習，引起接近和消費行為，並引發積極的情感，從而增加生存和繁殖的可能性<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Schultz&#95;5-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Schultz-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。 因此，獎賞是一種機制，它的進化有助於增加動物的適應性。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參見\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.A6.8B\"></span>參見</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%8A%92%E8%B5%8F%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：參見\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"犒賞依賴\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Reward dependence\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%8A%92%E8%B3%9E%E4%BE%9D%E8%B3%B4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"犒賞依賴（頁面不存在）\">犒賞依賴</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reward_dependence\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Reward dependence\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Reward dependence</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"腦刺激犒賞\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Brain stimulation reward\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%85%A6%E5%88%BA%E6%BF%80%E7%8A%92%E8%B3%9E&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"腦刺激犒賞（頁面不存在）\">腦刺激犒賞</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brain_stimulation_reward\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Brain stimulation reward\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Brain stimulation reward</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"参考文献\"><span id=\".E5.8F.82.E8.80.83.E6.96.87.E7.8C.AE\"></span>參考文獻</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%8A%92%E8%B5%8F%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：參考文獻\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media sc